description:
Meta Avatars will not change anything beyond simple meetings

if yes : Meta Avatars will be a flash in the pan and change nothing beyond simple meetings, there will be no killer app or use case. (The meeting pool will be more ubiqitous than anything else?)

if no : Meta Avatars will be used for various use cases and change the way we think about communicating digitally.  (Other use cases will be more ubiqitous than the meeting pool)

following the recent podcast between Lex and Mark do you believe the technology demonstrated is significant or not?
